" r=\"2\"/><path d=\"M7.6 20.4v-2.6a4.4 4.4 0 0 1 8.8 0v2.6\"/><path d=\"M2.2 18.4v-1a3.2 3.2 0 0 1 4.8-2.8M21.8 18.4v-1a3.2 3.2 0 0 0-4.8-2.8\"/></svg></span>\n      <h3>Education non-profits</h3>\n      <p>Organisations focused on inclusion, literacy and student success.</p>\n      \n    </article><article class=\"kcard\">\n      <span class=\"kcard__ico\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><rect x=\"7\" y=\"2.8\" width=\"10\" height=\"18.4\" rx=\"2.2\"/><path d=\"M10.6 18h2.8\"/></svg></span>\n      <h3>Learning technology</h3>\n      <p>Assistive and ed-tech providers that support different ways of learning.</p>\n      \n    </article>\n  </div>\n</section>"},"elements":[]}]},{"id":"1a4c37f1","elType":"container","isInner":false,"settings":{"content_width":"full","_title":"edu.together","padding":{"unit":"px","top":"0","right":"0","bottom":"0","left":"0","isLinked":true},"flex_gap":{"unit":"px","size":0,"column":"0","row":"0"}},"elements":[{"id":"d1566815","elType":"widget","widgetType":"html","settings":{"html":"<section class=\"band--cream\" data-el=\"edu.together\" data-el-build=\"elementor\">\n  <div class=\"wrap section\">\n    \n  <div class=\"section-head reveal \">\n    <p class=\"eyebrow mb-s\">How we could work together</p>\n    <h2 class=\"h2\">Sport, learning and support — joined up.</h2>\n    \n  </div>\n    \n  <div class=\"kgrid kgrid--3\" data-stagger>\n    <article class=\"kcard\">\n      <span class=\"kcard__ico\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"8.6\"/><path d=\"M12 8.2l3.2 2.3-1.2 3.8h-4l-1.2-3.8z\"/><path d=\"M12 3.4v4.8M15.2 10.5l4.3-1.6M14 14.3l2.7 3.8M10 14.3l-2.7 3.8M8.8 10.5L4.5 8.9\"/></svg></span>\n      <h3>Inclusive sport &amp; PE</h3>\n      <p>Structured, sensory-aware sport sessions that build confidence and social skills.</p>\n      \n    </article><article class=\"kcard\">\n      <span class=\"kcard__ico\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M6.4 2.8h7.8l4.4 4.4v14H6.4z\"/><path d=\"M14.2 2.8v4.4h4.4M9.4 12h6M9.4 15.2h6M9.4 18.4h3.6\"/></svg></span>\n      <h3>Tutoring &amp; academic support</h3>\n      <p>Homework help, literacy and numeracy support alongside training.</p>\n      \n    </article><article class=\"kcard\">\n      <span class=\"kcard__ico\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><rect x=\"3.6\" y=\"4\" width=\"16.8\" height=\"12\" rx=\"1.4\"/><path d=\"M7 8h10M7 11h6\"/><circle cx=\"16\" cy=\"16\" r=\"2.6\"/><path d=\"M14.6 18.2l-.8 3 2.2-1 2.2 1-.8-3\"/></svg></span>\n      <h3>Teacher &amp; coach training</h3>\n      <p>Shared training on neurodiversity-affirming practice for staff and coaches.</p>\n      \n    </article><article class=\"kcard\">\n      <span class=\"kcard__ico\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M2.6 12.4l3.6-4.2 3.6 1.4 2.4-1.4 3.2.4 3.8 3.6\"/><path d=\"M2.6 12.4l3.4 3.2M21.4 12.2l-3.2 3.4\"/><path d=\"M8.6 14.6l1.6 1.6a1.2 1.2 0 0 0 1.7 0l.2-.2M11 13.4l2.4 2.4a1.2 1.2 0 0 0 1.7 0l.6-.6-3.6-3.8\"/></svg></span>\n      <h3>Placements &amp; internships</h3>\n      <p>Student placements and work experience inside the village.</p>\n      \n    </article><article class=\"kcard\">\n      <span class=\"kcard__ico\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M3.6 20.4h16.8\"/><rect x=\"5.2\" y=\"12\" width=\"3\" height=\"6.4\" rx=\".6\"/><rect x=\"10.6\" y=\"7.6\" width=\"3\" height=\"10.8\" rx=\".6\"/><rect x=\"16\" y=\"4\" width=\"3\" height=\"14.4\" rx=\".6\"/></svg></span>\n      <h3>Research &amp; outcomes</h3>\n      <p>Measuring what works and sharing results with families and schools.</p>\n      \n    </article><article class=\"kcard\">\n      <span class=\"kcard__ico\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"8.6\"/><path d=\"M3.4 12h17.2\"/><path d=\"M12 3.4c2.4 2.4 3.6 5.2 3.6 8.6s-1.2 6.2-3.6 8.6c-2.4-2.4-3.6-5.2-3.6-8.6s1.2-6.2 3.6-8.6z\"/></svg></span>\n      <h3>Family resources</h3>\n      <p>Parent workshops and resources in Canada and the Caribbean.</p>\n      \n    </article>\n  </div>\n  </div>\n</section>"},"elements":[]}]},{"id":"276a66c6","elType":"container","isInner":false,"settings":{"content_width":"full","_title":"edu.process","padding":{"unit":"px","top":"0","right":"0","bottom":"0","left":"0","isLinked":true},"flex_gap":{"unit":"px","size":0,"column":"0","row":"0"}},"elements":[{"id":"16f012e2","elType":"widget","widgetType":"html","settings":{"html":"<section class=\"wrap section\" data-el=\"edu.process\" data-el-build=\"elementor\">\n  \n  <div class=\"section-head reveal \">\n    <p class=\"eyebrow mb-s\">The process</p>\n    <h2 class=\"h2\">From first message to first program.</h2>\n    \n  </div>\n  \n  <ol class=\"psteps\" data-stagger>\n    <li class=\"psteps__item\"><span class=\"psteps__n\">01</span><h3>Tell us about you</h3><p>Share your organisation, the students you serve and what you’d like to explore.</p></li><li class=\"psteps__item\"><span class=\"psteps__n\">02</span><h3>Intro call</h3><p>Our education team will reach out within five business days to talk it through.</p></li><li class=\"psteps__item\"><span class=\"psteps__n\">03</span><h3>Shape a pilot</h3><p>Together we design a small pilot that fits your students, timetable and goals.</p></li><li class=\"psteps__item\"><span class=\"psteps__n\">04</span><h3>Agree &amp; launch</h3><p>We put a simple agreement in place and launch as programs open.</p></li>\n  </ol>\n</section>"},"elements":[]}]},{"id":"07717c50","elType":"container","isInner":false,"settings":{"content_width":"full","_title":"edu.form","padding":{"unit":"px","top":"0","right":"0","bottom":"0","left":"0","isLinked":true},"flex_gap":{"unit":"px","size":0,"column":"0","row":"0"}},"elements":[{"id":"fd1d522b","elType":"widget","widgetType":"html","settings":{"html":"<section class=\"wrap section section--flush-top\" id=\"edu-form\" data-el=\"edu.form\" data-el-build=\"plugin\">\n  <div class=\"split split--form\">\n    <div class=\"form-intro reveal\">\n      <h2 class=\"h2\">Become an education partner.</h2>\n      <p class=\"body-lg\">Tell us about your organisation and we’ll be in touch within five business days.</p>\n      <p class=\"small muted\">Education partnerships only. Other partnerships: <a class=\"text-link\" href=\"{{url:/partners/}}\">Partners &amp; Sponsors</a>.</p>\n    </div>\n    \n<form class=\"form\" data-preview-form>\n  <p class=\"small muted\">Fields marked <span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"color:var(--danger)\">*</span><span class=\"sr-only\">with an asterisk</span> are required.</p>\n  <div class=\"form__grid\">\n<div class=\"field\">\n  <label class=\"field__label\" for=\"f169\">Name<span class=\"req\" aria-hidden=\"true\">*</span></label>\n  <input type=\"text\" id=\"f169\" name=\"name\" autocomplete=\"name\" aria-describedby=\"f169-err\" required aria-required=\"true\">\n  \n  <span class=\"field__error\" id=\"f169-err\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"field\">\n  <label class=\"field__label\" for=\"f170\">Role or title<span class=\"req\" aria-hidden=\"true\">*</span></label>\n  <input type=\"text\" id=\"f170\" name=\"role-or-title\" autocomplete=\"organization-title\" aria-describedby=\"f170-err\" required aria-required=\"true\">\n  \n  <span class=\"field__error\" id=\"f170-err\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"field\">\n  <label class=\"field__label\" for=\"f171\">Organisation<span class=\"req\" aria-hidden=\"true\">*</span></label>\n  <input type=\"text\" id=\"f171\" name=\"organisation\" autocomplete=\"organization\" aria-describedby=\"f171-err\" required aria-required=\"true\">\n  \n  <span class=\"field__error\" id=\"f171-err\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"field\">\n  <label class=\"field__label\" for=\"f172\">Organisation type<span class=\"req\" aria-hidden=\"true\">*</span></label>\n  <select id=\"f172\" name=\"organisation-type\" aria-describedby=\"f172-err\" required aria-required=\"true\"><option value=\"\">Choose one</option><option value=\"School\">School</option><option value=\"School board or district\">School board or district</option><option value=\"College\">College</option><option value=\"University\">University</option><option value=\"Tutoring or learning centre\">Tutoring or learning centre</option><option value=\"Education non-profit\">Education non-profit</option><option value=\"Specialist practice\">Specialist practice</option><option value=\"Learning technology provider\">Learning technology provider</option><option value=\"Other education organisation\">Other education organisation</option></select>\n  \n  <span class=\"field__error\" id=\"f172-err\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"field\">\n  <label class=\"field__label\" for=\"f173\">Email<span class=\"req\" aria-hidden=\"true\">*</span></label>\n  <input type=\"email\" id=\"f173\" name=\"email\" autocomplete=\"email\" aria-describedby=\"f173-err\" required aria-required=\"true\">\n  \n  <span class=\"field__error\" id=\"f173-err\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"field\">\n  <label class=\"field__label\" for=\"f174\">Phone <span class=\"opt\">(optional)</span></label>\n  <input type=\"tel\" id=\"f174\" name=\"phone\" autocomplete=\"tel\" aria-describedby=\"f174-err\">\n  \n  <span class=\"field__error\" id=\"f174-err\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"field\">\n  <label class=\"field__label\" for=\"f175\">Province / state &amp; country<span class=\"req\" aria-hidden=\"true\">*</span></label>\n  <input type=\"text\" id=\"f175\" name=\"province-state-and-country\" aria-describedby=\"f175-err\" required aria-required=\"true\">\n  \n  <span class=\"field__error\" id=\"f175-err\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"field\">\n  <label class=\"field__label\" for=\"f176\">Students served <span class=\"opt\">(optional)</span></label>\n  <select id=\"f176\" name=\"students-served\" aria-describedby=\"f176-err\"><option value=\"\">Choose a range</option><option value=\"Under 100\">Under 100</option><option value=\"100–500\">100–500</option><option value=\"500–2,000\">500–2,000</option><option value=\"Over 2,000\">Over 2,000</option></select>\n  \n  <span class=\"field__error\" id=\"f176-err\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"field field--full\">\n  <label class=\"field__label\" for=\"f177\">Most interested in<span class=\"req\" aria-hidden=\"true\">*</span></label>\n  <select id=\"f177\" name=\"most-interested-in\" aria-describedby=\"f177-err\" required aria-required=\"true\"><option value=\"\">Choose one</option><option value=\"Inclusive sport &amp; PE\">Inclusive sport &amp; PE</option><option value=\"Tutoring &amp; academic support\">Tutoring &amp; academic support</option><option value=\"Teacher &amp; coach training\">Teacher &amp; coach training</option><option value=\"Placements &amp; internships\">Placements &amp; internships</option><option value=\"Research &amp; outcomes\">Research &amp; outcomes</option><option value=\"Family resources\">Family resources</option><option value=\"Not sure yet\">Not sure yet</option></select>\n  \n  <span class=\"field__error\" id=\"f177-err\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"field field--full\">\n  <label class=\"field__label\" for=\"f178\">Tell us more <span class=\"opt\">(optional)</span></label>\n  <textarea id=\"f178\" name=\"tell-us-more\" aria-describedby=\"f178-err\" rows=\"4\" placeholder=\"\"></textarea>\n  \n  <span class=\"field__error\" id=\"f178-err\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span>\n</div></div>\n  <label class=\"check\" for=\"f168\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"f168\" name=\"consent\" required aria-describedby=\"f168-err\"><span>I agree to be contacted about an education partnership with AFSV VRC.<span class=\"field__error\" id=\"f168-err\"></span></span></label>\n  <div class=\"form-status\" role=\"status\" tabindex=\"-1\" hidden><strong>Thank you.</strong>Development preview — this form is not connected yet. When connected, enquiries go to the education team at info@afsvhcl.com.</div>\n  <div><button type=\"submit\" class=\"btn btn--navy\">Send partnership enquiry<span class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg class=\"icon \" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M4 12h15M13 6l6 6-6 6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/></svg></span></button></div>\n</form>\n  </div>\n</section>"},"elements":[]}]}]}